        <item><strong>Documentação oficial (Cuidados metodológicos):</strong> <link to="https://scikit-learn.org/stable/common_pitfalls.html">Scikit-learn — Common Pitfalls</link> e <link to="https://scikit-learn.org/stable/user_guide.html">Guia do usuário</link>.</item>
      </list>
    </section>
